---
system: sys-07-parent-controls-summary
flow_id: daily-summary-generation
surface: cron
spec_anchor: /software/systems/07-parent-controls-summary#daily-summary-worker
actors: [EventBridge, SQS, SummaryWorker, PostgreSQL, NotificationQueue]
apis: []
externals: [EventBridge, SQS]
queues:
  - controls.summary.daily
  - controls.summary.daily.dlq
  - tbot-notifications
failure_paths:
  - worker_crash_mid_batch
  - upsert_constraint_violation
  - dlq_redelivery_exhausted
idempotency: upsert ON CONFLICT (device_id, child_profile_id, summary_date)
retry: SQS 3 retries with exponential backoff (30s, 5m, 30m); DLQ after 3 fails
timeout: 300s visibility timeout per message
status: final
---
%% HAND-CURATED. Cron-driven aggregation; upsert keys make replay idempotent.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant EventBridge
    participant SQS as SQS controls.summary.daily
    participant SummaryWorker
    participant PostgreSQL
    participant NotificationQueue as SQS tbot-notifications

    EventBridge->>SQS: cron(0 3 * * ? *) enqueue {target_date}
    SQS->>SummaryWorker: deliver message (visibility 300s)
    SummaryWorker->>PostgreSQL: SELECT aggregates per (device_id, child_profile_id) for target_date

    loop per aggregated row
        alt upsert_constraint_violation
            SummaryWorker->>PostgreSQL: INSERT ... ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE
            PostgreSQL-->>SummaryWorker: error (other than unique)
            Note over SummaryWorker: increment summaries_failed counter — continue loop
        else upserted
            SummaryWorker->>PostgreSQL: INSERT daily_summaries ... ON CONFLICT (device_id,child_profile_id,summary_date) DO UPDATE
            PostgreSQL-->>SummaryWorker: ok
        end
    end

    alt worker_crash_mid_batch
        SummaryWorker--xSQS: message not ACKed
        Note over SQS,SummaryWorker: SQS redelivers — upsert idempotent → no duplicates
        SQS->>SummaryWorker: redeliver (attempt 2 of 3)
    else dlq_redelivery_exhausted
        SQS--xSQS: 3 attempts failed
        Note over SQS: move to controls.summary.daily.dlq — PagerDuty after 30 min depth>0
    else completed
        SummaryWorker->>NotificationQueue: enqueue {event: summary.daily.generated, target_date, summaries_created}
        SummaryWorker-->>SQS: ACK
    end

    Note over EventBridge,NotificationQueue: idempotent via unique (device_id, child_profile_id, summary_date) — no daily row for inactive days
